    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44515" root="&#xA;                        ودى&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْدَى بِهِ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>It destroyed him;</i> (T;) <i>it removed him,</i> or <i>took him away:</i> (M, K:) said
of death [&amp;c.]. (T, M, K.) See an ex. in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بلو</span>, conj. 8, and another voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَزْلَمُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْدَى</span>:
see a verse cited voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلَبَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْدَى العَيْرُ إِلّا</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرِطًا</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرَطَ</span>.

